Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's play chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:27.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will wait for you to be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:57.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(181,603)\fad(600,600}6 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:02:59.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Push !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:00.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Harder !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Awesome !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:10.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mister Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother and daughter are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:14.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the kid's body
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,is very weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll have to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Definitely. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:20.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:43.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473,462)\fad(300,300)}Zhou Ru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Given how weak Wan'er's Nascent Soul is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will take about 18 years for her to wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,and recover her memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,At that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,the law of the heavens will surely come again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(972,503)}1 year later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Going through Chu is the easiest way to reach the Immortal Graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then it's up to Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't come to Chu in 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:31.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,There seems to be many changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:32.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes it has,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that nowadays the Cloud Sky Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the number one sect in Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not what it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,A messenger from Suzaku ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is he doing here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mount Suzaku ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that in 3 months,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the western Heaven Temple,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:07.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are to fight Red Butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:15.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go back and tell them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,that if they want a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will have to be in 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Ceng Niu is really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even give in to the country of Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old friends in the valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:36.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old friends ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:48.28,Third,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:52.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I should call you fellow cultivator Wang
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,or fellow cultivator Ceng.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Names are just what we call each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry too much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Senior's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope Senior can forgive my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I understand correctly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're going to the Immortal Graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to find your father's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't you come with us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did you agree to go, fellow cultivator Sun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:32.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside the Immortal Graveyard there's a relic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,named the Reincarnation Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior has a map that can lead us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you meditate under it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can experience a life cycle, it's useful for Soul Formation domains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This may be helpful for Nascent Soul cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,but for those above the middle stage of Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,the effects are minimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I believe fellow cultivator Sun has other goals for this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.52,0:07:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang is very insightful,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Zi Xin, don't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it was just for the Reincarnation Tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:10.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't follow you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,What I want
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the Reincarnation Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Reincarnation Fruit ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Reincarnation Fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,will increase one's chance of reaching Soul Transformation by 30%.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a treasure for us Soul Formation cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Brother Wang is willing to go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,harvest Reincarnation Fruits,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will split them evenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:31.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How does it sound ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If they're so precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't you just keep them for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,instead of asking me for help ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang doesn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the Immortal Graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.52,0:07:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a very dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1581,507)\fad(300,300)}Entrance of the\NImmortal Graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the home of powerful native savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even the country of Suzaku dreads them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Brother Wang accompanies me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,this trip will be much safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:58.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as we find the Reincarnation Tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have a method for it to bear fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,within 3 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interested now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about this:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:16.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will wait for you outside the Immortal Graveyard for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don’t come,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will go on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:22.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tu Si's memory mentioned the Reincarnation Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If smeared over an Ancient God's body
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will cleanse the meridians
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,and merge with the flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The speed at which the body absorbs energy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:43.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,will increase significantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:45.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This process
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,is called body cleansing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only through body cleansing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,can one be regarded as a true Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:57.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1577,498)\fad(300,300}Red Butterfly's residence\NCountry of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:05.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Elders were furious because Ceng Niu postponed the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:08.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go down there to catch him myself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,but these guys stopped me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't even know who this Ceng Niu is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they intervened 3 times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't I sneak down the mountain and kill him for you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if they find out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,they will only punish me to 100 years of secluded cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stay here Senior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:30.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu wanted to destroy my Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,but he never thought that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,not only was it not destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's even more complete now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the intentions of Mount Suzaku are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,regarding our upcoming battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this is exactly what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:54.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1625,459)\fad(300,000}Spirit of the Eastern Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Spirit of the Eastern Sea that I've found,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will regrow your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:56.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:09:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every time I look at my empty sleeve,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:04.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,my urge to kill Ceng Niu increases.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Until I kill Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,my arm will stay missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's using my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,to curse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely going to kill you !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:22.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,One more poison curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,just in case she shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:28.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The country of Suzaku knows where I'm hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they didn't tell Red Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and only sent a challenge letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This battle with Red Butterfly is inevitable
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I'd better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm taking back the Beast Trap
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to use for this beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:16.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you wish to stay, then follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don’t, then you may leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:36.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capture !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Restrain !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you thought about it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:29.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you're following me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:37.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've had a busy day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,go get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come, dinner's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,in 18 years
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:26.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will remember everything about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's when
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the law of the heavens will come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must be prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,to face it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Immortal Graveyard can help me raise my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,So even if it's dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,While I'm gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:05.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will take care of Wan'er.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have the talent
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:10.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you're hard-working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Keep it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you will reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,study it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Ru, look !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Wang Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,promised Senior Zhou Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,to take care of you for 1000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:53.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior will go to the Immortal Graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:57.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a very dangerous place
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I would like to borrow a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sword Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will need a Sword Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm finally out !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm your slave, you could treat me better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,With a devil as the Sword Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only utilize a fraction of the sword's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I get the chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:55.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must look for a more suitable Sword Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,it has been a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are we still waiting ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:16.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many floors there are in this place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But my father said before
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that this place is relatively safe above the fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.16,0:16:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,The lower you go, the more dangerous it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm certain that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Reincarnation Tree is on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,My father saw it with his own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Including Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,with 3 Soul Formation cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:37.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,as long as we avoid the fourth floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,it should be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if he doesn't come...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:48.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had some minor trouble along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I found this person following me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:00.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,after I entered the Immortal Graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,He was trying to ambush me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is he one of the native savages ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,the savages cannot leave the underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did he end up here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:14.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's something going on in the Immortal Graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:24.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1592,510)\fad(300,300}Immortal Graveyard\NFirst floor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the second floor is east of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't scan it all with my Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1594,490)\fad(300,000}Tattoo puppets\NImmortal Graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, help me !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The skulls of these men
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,are same as what you found above ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,none of them were savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:15.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tattoo puppets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's just regular puppets ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is said that the real savages
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,can turn a cultivator into a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The characteristic of these puppets
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,are these tattoo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:33.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But these tattoo puppets are not as powerful as a real savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't usually run into them until the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know why they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.52,0:18:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This leaf on the head of the puppet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:43.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,what does it mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:45.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Miss ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lady Zi Xin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:47.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,the entrance is just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Miss, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:01.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1525,514)\fad(300,000}Forsaken Immortal Clan\N3-leaf Shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,A real savage
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,with Nascent Soul cultivation !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,(Forsaken Immortal Clan's language) Invaders,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,going to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:27.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why are there such savages
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,in planet Suzaku's underground ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:53.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:55.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:56.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:04.46,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:04.46,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:12.06,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:12.06,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:19.62,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:19.62,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:22.94,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:22.94,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.23,0:20:26.66,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:26.66,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:30.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:34.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:38.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:42.22,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:42.22,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:47.18,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:47.18,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:49.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:53.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:57.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:01.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:05.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:11.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:15.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:20.18,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:20.18,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:23.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:28.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.15,0:21:31.42,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:36.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:40.10,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:42.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:46.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:50.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:55.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
